 into water using Drag Down is forced movement for the target creature, but not for the drenchdead.</p>"},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"rarity":"common","value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!4cN2ZRzp54DolLkV.5ctvamroe8ajizmd"},{"_id":"iutmvzp6aq8ubdqv","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/TwoActions.webp","name":"Drowning Touch","sort":600000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"action"},"actions":{"value":2},"category":"offensive","description":{"value":"<p>The drenchdead touches a creature and causes water from its own body to flow into the creature's lungs. If the creature can't breathe water, it must attempt a @Check[fortitude|dc:32] save.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature is unaffected and is temporarily immune to Drowning Touch for 24 hours.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{Sickened 3}.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature chokes on the water and runs out of air. It falls @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fBnFDH2MTzgFijKf]{Unconscious} and starts drowning. If the creature is above water, it recovers from drowning as soon as it succeeds at a saving throw against suffocation.</p>"},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"rarity":"common","value":["incapacitation","occult","water"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!4cN2ZRzp54DolLkV.iutmvzp6aq8ubdqv"},{"_id":"wfrdw45o1bdjmfyz","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","name":"Surface Skimmer","sort":700000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"